Block Shooter: controls
=======================

Left mouse button   on a waiting block beside the field: shoot it in
                    (the front block of that row or column goes)
                    on RESTART (top left): end this game
                    after GAME OVER: a new game
Esc                 quit

The blocks slide until they meet another. Three or more of one colour
touching vanish: 3 points for three, 3 more for each block past three.
A block's arrow keeps it moving that way whenever the way opens; one that
slides off the field goes back to the queue on that side. Clear the field
for 100 points and a new one. The game ends when every square round the
field's edge is taken.
